---
import GuideArticleLayout from '../../layouts/GuideArticleLayout.astro';
---

<GuideArticleLayout 
	title="Progress Tracking" 
	description="Learn how daily focus sessions and task completions are tracked."
>
	<section class="space-y-4">
		<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[1.65rem] font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50 tracking-tight">Local Storage</h2>
		<p class="text-base sm:text-[16px] text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
			Your daily progress is tracked automatically and stored locally in your browser (private, offline-first, no account required).
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="space-y-4">
		<h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-[1.65rem] font-semibold text-zinc-950 dark:text-zinc-50 tracking-tight">Color Scaling</h2>
		<p class="text-base sm:text-[16px] text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
			Completing tasks or focus sessions colors your daily grid:
		</p>
		<ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1 text-base sm:text-[16px] text-zinc-700 dark:text-zinc-300 leading-relaxed">
			<li><strong>0 Tasks:</strong> Not counted / empty</li>
			<li><strong>1 Task:</strong> Dark Blue</li>
			<li><strong>2 Tasks:</strong> Medium Blue</li>
			<li><strong>3+ Tasks:</strong> Bright Blue</li>
		</ul>
	</section>
</GuideArticleLayout>
